  - m_Id: 7309447270
    m_Localized: Welcome to the toy car store! Pick up cars from the floor pile.
      Match each car to the shelf with its model and color. Each shelf needs seven
      copies. Wrong cars can be taken back. Buy upgrades with coins from correct
      placements. There is no timer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
